# Versioning

Follow `.cursor/skills/versioning/SKILL.md`.

One `MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` for Cargo workspace version and `MODULE.bazel`
`module(version)`. Tags are `v` plus that number (`v0.0.1`). No `v` in
Bazel/Cargo.

While major is 0: breaking API or on-disk format → minor; compatible work →
patch. Do not tag or bump unless the user asked to release.

`docs/` document versions (`Document 11 … Version 0.1`) are not the crate
version.
